Bundled multilingual embedding assets
------------------------------------
Release bundles include sentence-transformers/paraphrase-multilingual-MiniLM-L12-v2,
with a pinned generic int8 ONNX conversion from
Xenova/paraphrase-multilingual-MiniLM-L12-v2 (Apache License 2.0).
Model contributors retain their copyrights. The complete license, notice,
upstream/export revisions and checksums ship in luna/assets/embeddings/.
Luna adds token-weighted chunk pooling and normalized vectors at inference;
the pinned exported weight files are distributed unchanged.

